  "product_info": {
    "title": "Bose QuietComfort Earbuds II (Triple Black)",
    "description": "It's a new benchmark for wireless audio excellence. Engineered with <b>CustomTune sound calibration</b>, they automatically adjust the sound profile and noise cancellation to your ears—ensuring every note sounds perfectly balanced. With </b>world-leading noise cancellation</b>, you can fully immerse yourself in music, podcasts, or calls without distractions. The <b>secure, customizable fit</b> ensures long-lasting comfort, whether you’re at the gym, on a flight, or working from home. Each earbud houses advanced </b>microphones that isolate your voice</b>, providing crisp, clear calls in any environment. Featuring <b>up to 6 hours of listening time</b> (plus 18 extra hours from the case), <b>IPX4 water resistance</b>, and <b>touch-based controls</b>, these earbuds combine luxury, technology, and everyday practicality. The <b>Bose Music App</b> enhances your experience with easy sound customization and software updates, making the </b>Bose QuietComfort Earbuds II</b> the ultimate companion for premium wireless listening.",
